From: Distributed Minds / Fleet-Control research
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Harden Signet 2 draft semantics before implementation
Base: kian-cx/signetprotocol@2ddb136ee941705d3e1c020eaddad93be65026f2

This documentation-only proposal applies the lowest-risk changes supported by
current cross-lane research: negotiated capabilities, resolver abstention,
pin freshness, scoped server-authority wording, explicit training contribution,
and a contract-first roadmap.

It intentionally does not yet introduce the full proposed semantic/profile
schema or package trust model; those are staged separately for review.

